1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
Listen to a conversation.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,880
Have you returned the books we borrowed from the library

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:09,020
Why? I thought we could keep them for six weeks.

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,760
Actually, it's now four weeks. They changed the policy.

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:17,000
I guess I forgot to tell you. That means they're due tomorrow

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:21,040
Exactly. In that case, I'll take care of it right now.
